    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Earth Glide",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The xorn can Burrow through any earthen matter, including rock. When it does so, the xorn moves at its full burrow Speed, leaving no tunnels or signs of its passing."
